# Toolbar control service (control/toolbar_service)
# Commands:
#   set_position  move to `position` (m), switches to manual mode
#   center        move to configured centre, switches to manual mode
#   hold          hold current position, switches to manual mode
#   auto          follow /tool_bar_position_cmd stream again
#   enable        allow commands to reach the actuator
#   disable       monitor only, actuator holds where it is
#   reset_fault   clear a latched fault (holds current position)
#   get_status

string command
float32 position
---
bool success
string message
string state
float32 current_position
float32 target_position
